Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Tyin-Editor contributors
Depends: libc6, libasound2, libudev1, libwayland-client0, libx11-6, libxkbcommon0, libxcb1, libvulkan1
Description: Native, resource-aware code editor
 Tyin-Editor combines a native editor, workspace explorer, Git panel, terminal,
 and configurable language-server support in one desktop application.
